     *    - Source: HSE (8 MHz)
     *    - PLLM = 1 (bits: 0b0000 = 0 -> /1) -> f_VCO_IN = 8 MHz / 1 = 8 MHz (valid: 2.66 to 16 MHz, STM32G474_Datasheet p.123)
